<section class="not-content">
  <h2>Harnesses</h2>
  <p>Mobius runs each agent through the Agent Client Protocol (ACP), on your own accounts. You bind each role to a Harness, a model and an effort.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <p><strong>Claude Code.</strong> The ACP adapter <code>@agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp</code>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <p><strong>Devin.</strong> The Devin CLI.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <p><strong>Antigravity.</strong> <code>agy_acp_server</code> from the ACP registry.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="last">
    Read the terms of each Harness in the <a href="https://github.com/Mobius-Toolkit/Mobius/blob/main/docs/install.md#3-install-and-log-in-to-the-harnesses">full install guide</a>.
  </p>
</section>

